        "mission_intent": "Subject: Tailored Control Baseline Development for Financial Reporting Systems\n\nWe need the internal controls team to develop an organizationally-tailored control baseline for our financial reporting environment, specifically targeting the general ledger platform and the consolidation engine that support our SEC quarterly and annual filings. As you know, our operating environment diverges from the standard assumptions underlying the NIST SP 800-53B baselines \u2014 we have hybrid cloud infrastructure, cross-border data flows for our EMEA subsidiaries, and heightened privacy obligations under multiple jurisdictions that the initial baselines don't fully address. The tailored baseline should incorporate relevant control enhancements and supplemental guidance derived from SP 800-53B, and I'd like the requirements engineering approach from SP 800-160 v1 to inform how we identify and validate control additions or eliminations. Please coordinate with the CISO and the Senior Agency Official for Privacy to ensure sign-off. The deliverable should include a fully specified set of controls, enhancements, and supplemental guidance with clear rationale for each tailoring decision. I need a draft ready for leadership review by the end of next month, ahead of our annual risk assessment cycle.",
